  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - On account of its improper design and excessive size, the proposed development would result in an obtrusive development and fail to remain subservient to the main house, causing harm to its character and visual appearance, and that of the existing streetscene and surrounding area. This would be contrary to policies CC1 (Context and Character), SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations) of the adopted Local Plan (2015) and the intentions of the adopted Residential Extension Guidelines SPD. ",
    "Reason : 2 - In the absence of sufficient details, the application has failed to demonstrate that safe and adequate transport provisions would be retained within the development, so as to comply with Local Plan policy EC2, the Council's residential and off-street parking policy and the intentions of the adopted Residential Extension Guidelines SPD."
